===Etymology===
From {{af|en|nature|-o-|-pathy}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Wodencafe-naturopathy.wav|a=US}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|alternative medicine}} A system of [[therapy]] that avoids synthetic drugs and surgery, while emphasizing the use of natural remedies (plants and the elements) and physical means (massage, acupuncture) to treat illness.

